graph TB
    subgraph External["External Clients"]
        Scheduler["Scheduler / llm-d-router"]
    end

    subgraph KVCacheManager["kv-cache-manager (Go Service — 8080/TCP)"]
        direction TB
        ScoreCompletions["/score_completions<br/>POST"]
        ScoreChatCompletions["/score_chat_completions<br/>POST"]
        Metrics["/metrics<br/>GET"]
    end

    subgraph CoreLibraries["Core Libraries (Go)"]
        direction TB
        Indexer["kvcache.Indexer<br/>Orchestrator"]
        TokenProcessor["kvblock.TokenProcessor<br/>FNV-64a over CBOR"]
        BlockIndex["kvblock.Index<br/>LRU / Redis / Valkey"]
        Scorer["kvblock.Scorer<br/>Longest-prefix scoring"]
        EventPool["kvevents.Pool<br/>Sharded ZMQ workers"]
    end

    subgraph Sidecars["Sidecar Services"]
        UDSTokenizer["uds_tokenizer<br/>Python gRPC<br/>UDS + 8082/TCP"]
        PVCEvictor["pvc_evictor<br/>Python multi-process<br/>Disk space manager"]
    end

    subgraph ExternalDeps["External Dependencies"]
        Redis["Redis / Valkey<br/>6379/TCP"]
        vLLMPods["vLLM / SGLang Pods<br/>5557/TCP ZMQ"]
        OTel["OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC"]
        K8sAPI["Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS"]
        HFHub["HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS"]
    end

    Scheduler -->|HTTP POST| ScoreCompletions
    Scheduler -->|HTTP POST| ScoreChatCompletions

    ScoreCompletions --> Indexer
    ScoreChatCompletions --> Indexer

    Indexer -->|tokenize prompt| TokenProcessor
    Indexer -->|lookup blocks| BlockIndex
    Indexer -->|compute scores| Scorer

    Indexer -->|gRPC over UDS| UDSTokenizer

    EventPool -->|subscribe| vLLMPods
    EventPool -->|update index| BlockIndex

    BlockIndex -->|read/write| Redis

    KVCacheManager -->|traces| OTel
    UDSTokenizer -->|download model| HFHub
    PVCEvictor -->|ZMQ publish| vLLMPods

    subgraph PodReconciler["pod_reconciler (Example)"]
        Reconciler["Pod Reconciler<br/>controller-runtime"]
    end

    Reconciler -->|watch Pods| K8sAPI
    Reconciler -->|auto-discover ZMQ endpoints| EventPool

